# Line endings are declared here so Git never has to guess.
#
# Without this file, core.autocrlf decides per file at checkout, which is why the
# .luau sources (CRLF, enforced by stylua.toml line_endings = "Windows") disagreed
# with every .md/.json/.toml/.ps1 file (LF) and the editor warned on each open.
#
#   text=auto -> Git normalises to LF inside the repository, so history stays portable.
#   eol=crlf  -> Git checks out CRLF in the working tree, matching stylua and PowerShell.

* text=auto eol=crlf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted or diffed as text.
*.rbxl binary
*.rbxlx binary
*.rbxm binary
*.rbxmx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.fbx binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# Generated by `selene generate-roblox-std`. Kept exactly as the generator writes it, and
# excluded from diffs because it is ~580 KB of machine-written YAML.
roblox.yml text eol=lf -diff
